# validator-arm-selection (shard a): every other run of the validator is in process, `vem_entry` from a copy
# sourced once (this process for the real tree, a chunk worker or a subshell for every other tree). These are its
# only command-line starts, each the byte-for-byte twin (stdout, stderr, exit) of an in-process run (cli_twin),
# one per exit code this shard exercises.
cli scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh cli-first-id
cli scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh cli-i66-refuse
cli scripts/validate-enforcement-map.sh cli-unknown-id
